    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[34].HasBackground
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[35].HasBackground
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[36].HasBackground
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[37].HasBackground
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[38].HasBackground
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[39].HasBackground
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[3].DialougeToType
      value: Luckily for her, a traveling huntsman was passing by and saved the little
        girl.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[40].HasBackground
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[41].HasBackground
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[42].HasBackground
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[4].DialougeToType
      value: The question is... who was this huntsman? and what happend to the little
        girl?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[5].DialougeToType
      value: Oh, how frightened I was! It was so dark inside!  Oh, thank You Sir!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[6].DialougeToType
      value: No Problem. A scream like yours would have a whole town running!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[7].DialougeToType
      value: I thought I realized too late when that decietful wolf almost swallowed
        me whole!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[8].DialougeToType
      value: Well, your safe now...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[9].DialougeToType
      value: ...Grandma...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[10].DialougeToType
      value: ...I'm... sorry for your loss kid.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[11].DialougeToType
      value: ...I don't think it would be safe for you to travel home alone. Would
        you like me to accompany you?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[12].DialougeToType
      value: Mama told me to not follow strangers.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[13].DialougeToType
      value: '*Sigh, Even though I saved your life, I understand your concern.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[14].DialougeToType
      value: You see, I am not just a travelling huntsman, or at least I was... Have
        you ever heard of the name-
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[15].DialougeToType
      value: Robin Hood?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[16].DialougeToType
      value: no.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[17].DialougeToType
      value: oh. (Damn I'm Old, I shouldn't assume everyone knows my name, especially
        in a secluded place like this, man I'm stupid).
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[18].DialougeToType
      value: Well... you DID save my life, and I know that other huntsmen around
        here are very kind. I guess you can escort me Mr Robin.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[19].DialougeToType
      value: Just call me Robin Hood.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[20].DialougeToType
      value: Red Riding Hood and Robin Hood leave the late Grandma's cottage and
        begin travelling to the girl's home.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[21].DialougeToType
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[22].DialougeToType
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[23].DialougeToType
      value: Still looking quite down, slowing us down. Quite hurt about ol' granny
        aern't ya.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[24].DialougeToType
      value: ...I should've done something.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[25].DialougeToType
      value: huh?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[26].DialougeToType
      value: "\"What big ears you have!\u201D\n\"What big eyes you have!\u201D\n\"What
        big hands you have!\u201D\nThat wolf stalked me, decieved me!"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[27].DialougeToType
      value: 'I should''ve listened to mama, stayed on the path.

        I shouldn''t
        have talked to that wolf, for I had not seen how wicked he was.

        It''s
        unfair! I wish I could have done anything to save granny!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[28].DialougeToType
      value: Oh god... I'm sorry for bringing it back up! I didn't mean to be so
        blunt!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[29].DialougeToType
      value: Ah! I'm sorry, i'm being loud, papa told me to be strong and to not
        cry in public.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[30].DialougeToType
      value: No No! it's natural to feel this way, especially after seeing... what
        happened to your grandma...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[31].DialougeToType
      value: ...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[32].DialougeToType
      value: ...You wish you could've done something?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[33].DialougeToType
      value: ...yes...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[34].DialougeToType
      value: Well, you can't change what happened, but how about I teach you something
        so it doesn't happen again to anyone else.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[35].DialougeToType
      value: Really?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[36].DialougeToType
      value: Remember when I said I am no regular huntsman, well I am actually a
        well known archer. THE archer everyone thinks of when you think of archery.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[37].DialougeToType
      value: 'I''ve used my skills as an outlaw to fight injustice against unfair
        circumstances, inspiring other merry men to follow me; to "Steal from the
        rich and give to the poor"! '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[38].DialougeToType
      value: And you, my tiny friend, are in need of help and insparation! So, how
        about it, wanna learn a thing or two from me?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[39].DialougeToType
      value: WOW!... so you're a criminal!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[40].DialougeToType
      value: YEAH! Wait NO NO! Well Kinda!?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[41].DialougeToType
      value: Hehehe! you're quite noble despite that. I wanna learn archery!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3391369841202962043, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: segments.Array.data[42].DialougeToType
      value: '*Sigh.. Wome- I mean Children.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5513434127003781097, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: LevelLoaderScript
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 810433566}
    - target: {fileID: 8935081576966769972, guid: 4267377e34b81d045a2a53a1726a6f6b, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: DialougeChecker
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
